Z||000008||DJRice||10-09-2000||04:14 PM||||I wouldnt necessarily go as far as to say just because Pontiac built a concept car with an engine in the back that they are going to bring back the Fiero except with a different name.  Its just a concept.  GM comes up with all kinds of sweet ideas that they decide not to build because they would be too cool.  <P>Besides that, the Banshee is already available for purchase....at your local Hot Wheels dealer.<P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR>"You mean like the back seat of a Volkswagen?"||||reg||1
